#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum Compute limitations {#quantum-compute-limitations}"
msgstr "Ograniczenia Quantum Compute {#quantum-compute-limitations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for `stretch` in Quantum Compute is currently experimental and has the following constraints:\n"
msgstr "Obsługa `stretch` w Quantum Compute jest obecnie eksperymentalna i ma następujące ograniczenia:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- At most one stretch variable per _qubit set_ between barriers (implicit and explicit). A qubit set is one or more qubits; these sets must be mutually exclusive.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Co najwyżej jedna zmienna stretch na _zestaw kubitów_ między barierami (niejawnymi i jawnymi). Zestaw kubitów to jeden lub więcej kubitów; zestawy te muszą być rozłączne.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Nieprawidłowe\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q0)  # Invalid because 2 stretches are applied on q0\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q0)  # Invalid because 2 stretches are applied on q0\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Prawidłowe\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q2)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q2)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- The area surrounded by a set of barriers is called a _barrier region_. A stretch variable cannot be used in multiple barrier regions.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Obszar otoczony zestawem barier nazywany jest _regionem bariery_. Zmienna stretch nie może być używana w wielu regionach barier.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Nieprawidłowe\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used in two barrier regions\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"         ```\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used in two barrier regions\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"         ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        ![Illustration of the previous code output](/docs/images/guides/stretch/bad-barrier-region.svg 'Invalid use of stretch in barrier regions')\n"
msgstr "        ![Illustration of the previous code output](/docs/images/guides/stretch/bad-barrier-region.svg 'Invalid use of stretch in barrier regions')\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Prawidłowe\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used inside a barrier region that is on q0 and q1\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier(q2)\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        ```\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used inside a barrier region that is on q0 and q1\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier(q2)\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        ![Illustration of the previous code output](/docs/images/guides/stretch/good-barrier-region.svg 'Valid use of stretch in a barrier region')\n"
msgstr "        ![Illustration of the previous code output](/docs/images/guides/stretch/good-barrier-region.svg 'Valid use of stretch in a barrier region')\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Stretch expressions are limited to those of the form `X*stretch + Y` where `X` and `Y` are floating point or integer constants.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Wyrażenia stretch są ograniczone do postaci `X*stretch + Y`, gdzie `X` i `Y` są stałymi zmiennoprzecinkowymi lub całkowitymi.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Nieprawidłowe\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        c = circuit.add_stretch(\"c\")\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        c = circuit.add_stretch(\"c\")\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        # (a /  b) * c is not supported\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.mul(expr.div(a, b), c), q1)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        # (a /  b) * c is not supported\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.mul(expr.div(a, b), c), q1)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Prawidłowe\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        from qiskit.circuit import Duration\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        from qiskit.circuit import Duration\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(expr.mul(a, 2), Duration.dt(3)), 0)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(expr.mul(a, 2), Duration.dt(3)), 0)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Stretch expressions can only include a single stretch variable.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"        <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Wyrażenia stretch mogą zawierać tylko jedną zmienną stretch.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"        <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Nieprawidłowe\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(a, b), 0)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(a, b), 0)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Prawidłowe\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(a, a), 0)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
